    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): CWMD Workshop (Combatting Transnational Crime in Africa)</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">The CWMD Workshop was delivered entailed 81 participants representing the United Nations, the African Union, twelve partner nations, private industry, and academia participated in the workshop. The workshop objective was to bring together cyber security experts and practitioners from the international and African regional communities to collaborate on cyber threat proliferation that is expanding across the international community.</narrative>
    </description>
